d</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.940" end="01:16.250"><span begin="01:10.940" end="01:11.120">I'm </span><span begin="01:11.120" end="01:11.210">11 </span><span begin="01:11.210" end="01:11.870">minutes </span><span begin="01:11.870" end="01:13.460">away </span><span begin="01:13.460" end="01:13.700">and </span><span begin="01:13.700" end="01:14.090">I </span><span begin="01:14.090" end="01:14.210">have </span><span begin="01:14.210" end="01:14.630">missed </span><span begin="01:14.630" end="01:14.840">you </span><span begin="01:14.840" end="01:15.170">all </span><span begin="01:15.170" end="01:16.250">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.310" end="01:22.220"><span begin="01:16.310" end="01:16.520">I'm </span><span begin="01:16.520" end="01:17.240">11 </span><span begin="01:17.240" end="01:17.900">minutes </span><span begin="01:17.900" end="01:19.400">away</span><span begin="01:19.400" end="01:19.430">, </span><span begin="01:19.430" end="01:19.640">so </span><span begin="01:19.640" end="01:20.000">why </span><span begin="01:20.000" end="01:20.270">aren't </span><span begin="01:20.270" end="01:20.450">you </span><span begin="01:20.450" end="01:22.040">here</span><span begin="01:22.040" end="01:22.220">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.220" end="01:28.070"><span begin="01:22.220" end="01:22.580">You're </span><span begin="01:22.580" end="01:23.210">11 </span><span begin="01:23.210" end="01:23.930">minutes </span><span begin="01:23.930" end="01:25.430">away </span><span begin="01:25.430" end="01:25.730">and </span><span begin="01:25.730" end="01:25.940">I </span><span begin="01:25.940" end="01:26.210">have </span><span begin="01:26.210" end="01:26.630">missed </span><span begin="01:26.630" end="01:26.900">you </span><span begin="01:26.900" end="01:27.320">all </span><span begin="01:27.320" end="01:28.070">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.220" end="01:35.240"><span begin="01:28.220" end="01:28.550">You're </span><span begin="01:28